00:03:39.400 --> 00:03:41.040
That is not a racial slur.

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:44.420
Personally, I don't feel comfortable using any slurs

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:46.960
If I haven't heard those slurs towards me

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:50.320
