00:03:58.120 --> 00:04:01.300
Three, two, one, go.

00:04:07.960 --> 00:04:14.080
In America today, walking down the street, it matters what you look like.

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:17.340
People are going to judge you based on the race that they perceive you to be.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.380
When I walk down the street,

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:22.100
People aren't going to look at me the same way as they look at someone who's perceived as Black.

00:04:22.100 --> 00:04:25.900
And so I just want to really acknowledge the reality of that.

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:29.700
I wouldn't disagree with you at all, but at the same time

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.560
