00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:35.060
Someone that has a Black parent that doesn't appear Black

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:37.200
They were still raised by a Black person.

00:04:37.200 --> 00:04:41.840
They still, like, everything that their parents experienced is passed down to them

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:43.700
Whether it's through story or just through actions.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.760
I'm actually going to move over to this line.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:48.080
Which I guess is more a middle line just because-

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:49.780
I can't do that?

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:51.400
Then I'm here, never mind.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:57.040
So I'm on "Somewhat Agree because, I'm an actor.

00:04:57.040 --> 00:05:00.080
