00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:58.880
I want to make it really clear that a White person

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:02.840
having a kid with a Black person does not mean that that person

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:07.980
does not have racist tendencies or is not discriminatory at all.

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:13.240
I love my Dad to death but sometimes he just says things where it's like

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:14.860
You shouldn't be saying that.

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:20.380
Plus like, even in a future if America becomes super mixed

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:24.060
